<title>USA: Banco do Brasil sets $400 mln in two-part debt.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil sets $400 mln in two-part debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following $400 million two-part 144A private placement debt offering from Banco do Brasil was priced on Wednesday via joint managers UBS Securities and BB Securities, dealers said.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANCO DO BRASIL</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 8.375	MATURITY 6/15/02</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.575  FIRST PAY DATE NA</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S N/A   YIELD 8.48	  PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P N/A	 SPREAD 200 BP     CALLABLE</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 9.375	MATURITY 6/15/07</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.219  FIRST PAY DATE NA</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S N/A   YIELD  9.497	PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P N/A	 SPREAD 287.5	CALLABLE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1675))</p>
</text>
